.len() as i64 - 1) as usize]));\n        assert_main_eq(&input);\n    }\n}\n'''\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY'\np='CONFIGS.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace('''| 27 | `driver` bin vs C bin (process) | randomized corpus (all shapes of rows 13–24) end-to-end, comparing stdout bytes **and** exit status | [x] |''','''| 27 | `driver` bin vs C bin (process) | randomized corpus (all shapes of rows 13–24) end-to-end, comparing stdout bytes **and** exit status | [x] |\n| 28 | `main` (FFI) | byte-level fuzz: 400 random strings over `[0-9+- \\\\t\\\\n\\\\r\\\\v\\\\f a b x e E . , NUL 0xFF /]`, length 0–24 | [x] |\n| 29 | `main` (FFI) | same fuzz prefixed with a 4090–4100 byte run so the token straddles the read chunk | [x] |''')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\ntime timeout 600 cargo test --offline --test valid_paths 2>&1 | tail -12","description":"Add fuzz rows and fix warnings"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":833,"cache_read_input_tokens":123126,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":833,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c52ecede-b212-4bcc-9ef3-1815ba16c715","uuid":"785fcc74-d739-4f05-a7db-7a62680ecd46","timestamp":"2026-08-18T12:12:29.136Z"}
